#. assessFieldworkDraft.0.0
#: src/js/fieldwork-model.js:270
msgctxt "text:assessFieldworkDraft.0.0"
msgid "{value0} of three listed items selected; the host must verify the rest."
msgstr "指定装備三件中{value0}件のみ。残りは現地主催者が照合。"

#. assessFieldworkDraft.0.0
#: src/js/fieldwork-model.js:273
msgctxt "text:assessFieldworkDraft.0.0.2"
msgid "High/variable-risk stations require a buddy or medical exit line at dispatch."
msgstr "高・変動リスク所は出発机で二人または医療退出線を追記。"

#. assessFieldworkDraft.0.0
#: src/js/fieldwork-model.js:276
msgctxt "text:assessFieldworkDraft.0.0.3"
msgid ""
"Clinical or mental-information work still needs encounter-by-encounter "
"consent after declaration."
msgstr "臨床・精神情報では能力申告後も現場で逐次同意が必要。"

#. note
#: src/js/fieldwork-model.js:388
msgctxt "text:note"
msgid "{value0}: Observation, report, and unresolved matters remain distinct. Seal granted."
msgstr "{value0}：見たこと、聞いたこと、未解決を区別できた。押印。"

#. note
#: src/js/fieldwork-model.js:390
msgctxt "text:note.2"
msgid ""
"{value0}: Passport may be stamped; keep the annex. Next time, place sources "
"before the conclusion."
msgstr "{value0}：旅券へ押印可、附件は保持。次は結論より先に資料源を。"

#. note
#: src/js/fieldwork-model.js:391
msgctxt "text:note.3"
msgid ""
"{value0}: Return certified, but the dispute must not become a tidy success "
"story. Red thread travels with the seal."
msgstr "{value0}：帰校可。ただし争議を美しい成功談にしない。赤糸は印と共に残す。"

